  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「うわぁああ……☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（すごぉい、おっきいですぅ！　あんなおっきな船が、どうやって海に浮かんでるんでしょう？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（けど豪華客船で、二泊三日の旅だなんて……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（わたしみたいな小市民が、そんな豪華な休日を過ごしていいんでしょうか？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（あうぅ、緊張してきました！　心臓がバクバクいってますぅ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（部長も、急に呼びだすんだもん。心の準備ができてません！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（しかも部長ったら、自分だけさっさと船に乗りこんで出迎えてもくれないし！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（壮大なドッキリだったらどうしよう～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（どうしよう？　意気揚々と船に乗りこんだら、『何できたの、あんた？』とか言われたら～？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（うう、不安になっちゃいますぅ！　ひとりで行動するの怖い！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（旅の道連れがほしいですぅ、どこかに顔見知りがいませんかね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「……あれっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はわわっ、えっと転校生さん！　おはようございます～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「転校生さんも、もしかして豪華客船に乗られるんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「よかったぁ、同じ学校のひとが一緒で……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えっ、ちがうんですか？　じゃあ、こんな波止場で何をしてるんです……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あっ、釣り竿。釣りを、してるんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「休日ですもんね、釣りって男のひとっぽい趣味ですね……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「趣味でもない？　えっと、よくわからないですぅ！　ごめんなさい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ふむ、ふむ。色々あって、人魚を釣らなくちゃいけないんですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「えっとでも、人魚って実在するんでしょうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あ、相変わらず不思議なひとですね、転校生さんは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「はうぅ……入院してるひとのために、不老不死の妙薬である人魚の肉を入手したいと？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「優しいんですね、転校生さんは♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わたし、そういうオカルト話は大好物ですぅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「詳しく話を聞かせてもらっても構いませんか、新聞の記事にしたいですぅ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「わわっ、はわわっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「転校生さん、釣り竿が引いてます！　お魚が、餌に食いついたのかもっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「うわっ……わわっ、すごい勢いで引っぱられてますよぅ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「大物ですねっ、まさかほんとに人魚？　スクープですぅ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「カメラ、カメラ……はわわっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「あっ、転校生さんが海に落ちちゃう！　ほんとに、すごい引き！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「たたた、たいへん！　わたしが後ろから支えますから、『いっせいのせ』で釣りあげましょう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "「ほんとに人魚だったら世紀の大発見だし、海に落ちたら風邪ひいちゃいますぅ！」"
